*
* ELEMENT: MQML [GEOMETRY]
* Parking: MQMLBODY
* Infos: 
* *******************************************
* 
* ( from Q7a FLUKA model by A.Mereghetti, 08/01/2009)
* magnetic length: 480.0 cm; 
* mechanical length (at working temperature): 498.3 cm;
*
* Copper tube, 80mm inner diameter, 2mm thick
* according to LHC-VC-ES-0001
*
* Mechanical length from LHCMQM__0002
* Return coil and end coil from LHCMQM__0021 and LHCMQM__0022
* magnet not symmetric. Model centre corrisponds to magnetic centre.
*
RCC MQMLBODY   0.0 -8.0 -250.4 0.0 0.0 497.8 45.7
XYP MQMLp1    -240.0
XYP MQMLp2     240.0
*
* Cryostat - construction steel (steel with low C)
ZCC MQMLCRYI   0.0 -8.0 45.2
*
* Bigger Thermal shield - Aluminum
ZCC MQMLTSHO   0.0 -8.0 36.0
ZCC MQMLTSHI   0.0 -8.0 35.0
ZCC MQMLoan    0.0 0.0 24.75
ZCC MQMLian    0.0 0.0 23.75
*
* collars:
ZCC MQMLpcol   9.7 0.0 7.04
ZCC MQMLncol   -9.7 0.0 7.04
*
* coils: x>0
ZCC MQMLc2po   9.7 0.0 4.612
ZCC MQMLc2pi   9.7 0.0 3.716
ZCC MQMLc1po   9.7 0.0 3.696
ZCC MQMLc1pi   9.7 0.0 2.800
PLA MQMLp032   -0.529919264 .848048096 0.0 9.7 0.0 -248.8
PLA MQMLp058   -.848048096 0.529919264 0.0 9.7 0.0 -248.8
PLA MQMLp122   -.848048096 -0.529919264 0.0 9.7 0.0 -248.8
PLA MQMLp148   -0.529919264 -.848048096 0.0 9.7 0.0 -248.8
* coils: x<0
ZCC MQMLc2no   -9.7 0.0 4.612
ZCC MQMLc2ni   -9.7 0.0 3.716
ZCC MQMLc1no   -9.7 0.0 3.696
ZCC MQMLc1ni   -9.7 0.0 2.800
PLA MQMLn032   -0.529919264 .848048096 0.0 -9.7 0.0 -248.8
PLA MQMLn058   -.848048096 0.529919264 0.0 -9.7 0.0 -248.8
PLA MQMLn122   -.848048096 -0.529919264 0.0 -9.7 0.0 -248.8
PLA MQMLn148   -0.529919264 -.848048096 0.0 -9.7 0.0 -248.8
*
* BP:
ZCC MQMLphe    9.7 0.0 2.69
ZCC MQMLbppo   9.7 0.0 2.65
ZCC MQMLbppi   9.7 0.0 2.5
ZCC MQMLnhe    -9.7 0.0 2.69
ZCC MQMLbpno   -9.7 0.0 2.65
ZCC MQMLbpni   -9.7 0.0 2.5
*
* BS (V -> B1)
