$start_translat  700.0 -3000.0  1000.0 
* -*- fluka -*-
*
* Element: MCBX 
*
*
* @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
* @@@
* @@@   FLUKA model of MCBX, 12/01/2012
* @@@   A. Lechner, based on existing model and drawing LHCMCBX_0003
* @@@
* @@@   Mechanical length: 70.0 cm
* @@@   Magnetic length MCBXH: 45.0 cm
* @@@   Magnetic length MCBXV: 48.0 cm
* @@@   Mechanical/Magnetic middle offset: 1.1 cm (drawing LHCMCBX_0012)  
* @@@
* @@@   Origin of model coincides with magnetic center
* @@@     
* @@@   Defines: Use '#define IR5' to rotate beam screen according to  
* @@@            IR5 specs 
* @@@          : Use '#define __MCBXBODY_AS_VERTICAL_KICKER__', 
* @@@                '#define __MCBXBODY_AS_HORIZONTAL_KICKER__',
* @@@            IR1, IR5 to determine magnetic length according to kick 
* @@@            direction
* @@@
* @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
*
*
RCC MCBXBODY   0.0 0.0 -33.9 0.0 0.0 70.0 17.5
*
* ### Planes defining magnetic field regions ###
* Set magnetic length according to kick direction. Extra-flexibility due to 
* different crossing schemes in IR8
#if __MCBXBODY_AS_VERTICAL_KICKER__
XYP MCBXp1     -24.0
XYP MCBXp2     24.0
#elif __MCBXBODY_AS_HORIZONTAL_KICKER__
XYP MCBXp1     -22.5
XYP MCBXp2     22.5
#elif IR1
XYP MCBXp1     -24.0
XYP MCBXp2     24.0
#elif IR5
XYP MCBXp1     -22.5
XYP MCBXp2     22.5
#else
* Default case vertical kick as per IR1
XYP MCBXp1     -24.0
XYP MCBXp2     24.0
#endif
*
* ### Outer shell ###
* (see drawings LHCMCBXB_0001)
ZCC MCBXshl    0.0 0.0 16.0
*
* ### Iron lamination ###
* (see drawings LHCMCBX_0008, LHCMCBX_0003)
ZCC MCBXyke    0.0 0.0 9.00
*
* ### Shrinking cylinder ###
* (see drawings LHCMCBX_0009, LHCMCBX_0003)
ZCC MCBXshc    0.0 0.0 7.55
ZCC MCBXoce    0.0 0.0 7.36
* ### Outer coil MCBXH ###
* (see drawings LHCMCBX_0002, LHCMCBX_0003)
ZCC MCBXoci    0.0 0.0 6.04
ZCC MCBXice    0.0 0.0 5.84
* ### Inner coil MCBXV ###
* (see drawings LHCMCBX_0001, LHCMCBX_0003)
ZCC MCBXici    0.0 0.0 4.52
* inner coil insulator
ZCC MCBXicIn   0.0 0.0 4.50
*
* ### Cold bore ###
* To be verified
ZCC MCBXcbo    0.0 0.0 3.325
ZCC MCBXcbi    0.0 0.0 3.149
*
* ### Beam screen cooling ##
#if IR5
ZCC MCBXh1i    0.0 -2.83 0.17
ZCC MCBXh1o    0.0 -2.83 0.23
ZCC MCBXh2i    0.0 2.83 0.17
ZCC MCBXh2o    0.0 2.83 0.23
#elif IR1
ZCC MCBXh1i    -2.83 0.0 0.17
ZCC MCBXh1o    -2.83 0.0 0.23
ZCC MCBXh2i    2.83 0.0 0.17
ZCC MCBXh2o    2.83 0.0 0.23
#else
* Default case IR1
ZCC MCBXh1i    -2.83 0.0 0.17
ZCC MCBXh1o    -2.83 0.0 0.23
ZCC MCBXh2i    2.83 0.0 0.17
ZCC MCBXh2o    2.83 0.0 0.23
#endif
*
* ### Beam screen ##
ZCC MCBXbso    0.0 0.0 3.07
ZCC MCBXbsi    0.0 0.0 3.0025
*
#if IR5
XZP MCBXbp1    -2.59
XZP MCBXbp2    -2.5225
XZP MCBXbp3    2.5225
XZP MCBXbp4    2.59
#elif IR1
YZP MCBXbp1    -2.59
YZP MCBXbp2    -2.5225
YZP MCBXbp3    2.5225
YZP MCBXbp4    2.59
#else
* Default case IR1
YZP MCBXbp1    -2.59
YZP MCBXbp2    -2.5225
YZP MCBXbp3    2.5225
YZP MCBXbp4    2.59
#endif
XZP MCBXplxz   0.0
YZP MCBXplyz   0.0
