XZP MQXAykk4   4.0
XZP MQXAykk5   1.0
XZP MQXAykk6   -1.0
XZP MQXAykk7   -4.0
XZP MQXAykk8   -6.0
*
* ### Yoke fixing pins ###
* Following dimensions are taken from Ref. [2]
