ZCC MQXAykf2  -3.8500 14.4975 1.50 
ZCC MQXAykf3  3.8500 -14.4975 1.50 
ZCC MQXAykf4  -3.8500 -14.4975 1.50 
ZCC MQXAykf5  14.4975 3.8500 1.50 
ZCC MQXAykf6  -14.4975 3.8500 1.50 
ZCC MQXAykf7  14.4975 -3.8500 1.50 
ZCC MQXAykf8  -14.4975 -3.8500 1.50 
*
* ### Collar ###
* Following dimension is from Ref. [2]
ZCC MQXAcole    0.0 0.0 9.20
* 
* ### Coils and insulation ###
PLA MQXApc1   -1.2375435 -0.5 0.0 -0.5 1.2375435 0.0
PLA MQXApc2   0.5 1.2375435 0.0 -1.2375435 0.5 0.0
