PLA MQXApc7   -0.5 0.714075 0.0 0.714075 0.5 0.0
PLA MQXApc8   0.714075 -0.5 0.0 0.5 0.714075 0.0
* 
ZCC MQXAin5     0.0 0.0 8.20
ZCC MQXAco4     0.0 0.0 8.11
ZCC MQXAin4     0.0 0.0 7.00
ZCC MQXAco3     0.0 0.0 6.95
