* @@@             http://tomato.fnal.gov/lhcirq/drawings/index.html
* @@@ 
* @@@   Mechanical length: 21.15 cm
* @@@   Magnetic length MCOSX/MCOX/MCSSX: 13.8/13.7/13.2 cm (first taken)
* @@@   Mechanical/Magnetic middle offset: ??? cm 
* @@@ 
* @@@   Model origin coincides with optical center of MCOSX/MCOX/MCSSX  
* @@@     
* @@@   Open issues: 
* @@@            *) Calculate actual coil composition (now approximated
* @@@               with Cu)
* @@@            *) Determine actual composition of insulator betw. coils
* @@@            *) Include vacuum vessel
* @@@     
