               | +MCBXbLQ2 +MCBXb2ms +MCBXb213 -MCBXb214
MCBXb2tb     5 | +MCBXbLQ2 -MCBXb2me +MCBXb211 -MCBXb212
               | +MCBXbLQ2 -MCBXb2me +MCBXb213 -MCBXb214
