ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  MQXAb3vf  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  MQXAb3vb  
*
* ### Beam screen ### 
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   MQXAb3s                           1.0   
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MQXAb3sf
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MQXAb3sb  
