ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  MQXAb3hf
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  MQXAb3hb
*
* ### Vacuum between beam screen and beam pipe ### 
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   MQXAb3c                           1.0   
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  MQXAb3cf  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  MQXAb3cb  
*
* ### Beam pipe ### 
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   MQXAb3p                           1.0   
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MQXAb3pf
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MQXAb3pb
