* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- *
* 'assm' file for BASIC_ELEMENT: 'lhc_MCBXBODY'                                *
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- *
*                                                                              *
* 
*
* -*- fluka -*-
*
* Element: MCBX 
*
*
* @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
* @@@
* @@@   FLUKA model of MCBX, 12/01/2012
* @@@   A. Lechner, based on existing model and drawing LHCMCBX_0003
* @@@
* @@@   Mechanical length: 70.0 cm
* @@@   Magnetic length MCBXH: 45.0 cm
* @@@   Magnetic length MCBXV: 48.0 cm
* @@@   Mechanical/Magnetic middle offset: 1.1 cm (drawing LHCMCBX_0012)  
* @@@
* @@@   Origin of model coincides with magnetic center
* @@@     
* @@@   Defines: Use '#define IR5' to rotate beam screen according to  
* @@@            IR5 specs 
* @@@          : Use '#define __MCBXBODY_AS_VERTICAL_KICKER__', 
* @@@                '#define __MCBXBODY_AS_HORIZONTAL_KICKER__',
* @@@            IR1, IR5 to determine magnetic length according to kick 
* @@@            direction
* @@@
* @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
*
*
* ### Outer shell ###
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   MCBXshl
*
* ### Iron lamination ###
ASSIGNMA    cLowCSTL   MCBXyke
*
* ### Shrinking cylinder ###
* Aluminium alloy AA 5083 (approx 94 perc Al), approximated with pure Al
ASSIGNMA       Al_4K   MCBXshc
*
* ### Outer coil MCBXH ###
* Modeled as pure Cu (according to wedges), coils neglected
ASSIGNMA     NbTi.w4   MCBXocl
*
* ### Inner coil MCBXV ###
* Modeled as pure Cu (according to wedges), coils neglected
ASSIGNMA     NbTi.w4   MCBXicl
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K   MCBXep1                            1.
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K   MCBXep2
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K   MCBXep3
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K   CBXocep
ASSIGNMA      Cu_87K   CBXocCu
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K   CBXicep
ASSIGNMA      Cu_87K   CBXicCu
*
* ### Beam pipe coolant ###
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K   MCBXbph
*
* ### Cold bore ###
* To be verified
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   MCBXcbo                            1.
*
* ### Beam screen cooling ##
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   MCBXbhp                            1.
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K   MCBXbhe                            1.
*
* ### Beam screen ##
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   MCBXbsc                            1.
*
* ### Vacuum ##
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   MCBXvac                            1.
*
* IP-SIDE end-cup
* ### Outer shell ###
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXBshl
*
* ### Iron lamination ###
ASSIGNMA    cLowCSTL  MCBXByke
*
* ### Shrinking cylinder ###
* Aluminium alloy AA 5083 (approx 94 perc Al), approximated with pure Al
ASSIGNMA       Al_4K  MCBXBshc
*
* ### Outer coil MCBXH ###
* Modeled as pure Cu (according to wedges), coils neglected
ASSIGNMA     NbTi.w4  MCBXBocl
*
* ### Inner coil MCBXV ###
* Modeled as pure Cu (according to wedges), coils neglected
ASSIGNMA     NbTi.w4  MCBXBicl
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K  MCBXBep1                            1.
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K  MCBXBep2
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K  MCBXBep3
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K  CBXBocep
ASSIGNMA      Cu_87K  CBXBocCu
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K  CBXBicep
ASSIGNMA      Cu_87K  CBXBicCu
*
* ### Beam pipe coolant ###
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  MCBXBbph
*
* ### Cold bore ###
* To be verified
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXBcbo
*
* ### Beam screen cooling ##
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXBbhp
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  MCBXBbhe
*
* ### Beam screen ##
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXBbsc
*
* ### Vacuum ##
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  MCBXBvac
*
* NOT IP-SIDE end-cup
* ### Outer shell ###
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXFshl
*
* ### Iron lamination ###
ASSIGNMA    cLowCSTL  MCBXFyke
*
* ### Shrinking cylinder ###
* Aluminium alloy AA 5083 (approx 94 perc Al), approximated with pure Al
ASSIGNMA       Al_4K  MCBXFshc
*
* ### Outer coil MCBXH ###
* Modeled as pure Cu (according to wedges), coils neglected
ASSIGNMA     NbTi.w4  MCBXFocl
*
* ### Inner coil MCBXV ###
* Modeled as pure Cu (according to wedges), coils neglected
ASSIGNMA     NbTi.w4  MCBXFicl
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K  MCBXFep1                            1.
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K  MCBXFep2
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K  MCBXFep3
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K  CBXFocep
ASSIGNMA      Cu_87K  CBXFocCu
ASSIGNMA    EPOXY87K  CBXFicep
ASSIGNMA      Cu_87K  CBXFicCu
*
* ### Beam pipe coolant ###
