*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+..
COMPOUND   -.3142386      IRON  -0.08658  CHROMIUM  -0.05265    NICKELDQR
COMPOUND    -0.00936  MANGANES  -0.00468   SILICON -2.106D-4   PHOSPHODQR
COMPOUND   -1.404D-4    SULFUR -1.404D-4    CARBON  -0.06384  HYDROGENDQR
COMPOUND    -0.46816    OXYGEN                                        DQR
* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+..
ASSIGNMA         DQR      RDQR
