* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- *
* 'assm' file for BASIC_ELEMENT: 'lhc_MCBXbLQ1'                                *
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- *
*                                                                              *
* 
*
* -*- fluka -*-
*
* Element: MCBX beam pipe and screen (1.9K, Q1)
*
*
* @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
* @@@
* @@@   FLUKA model of MCBX beam pipe and screen (1.9K, Q1), 14/11/2012 
* @@@   (A. Lechner)
* @@@ 
* @@@   Beam pipe ID/OD: 5.3/6.6 cm
* @@@ 
* @@@   Beam screen dimensions from: LHC Project Document LHC-VSS-ES-0002 
* @@@ 
* @@@   Defines: Use
* @@@             '#define __MCBXBODY_AS_VERTICAL_KICKER__','#define IR1' 
* @@@             '#define __MCBXBODY_AS_HORIZONTAL_KICKER__','#define IR5' 
* @@@            to determine magnetic length according to kick 
* @@@            direction (IR1, IR5)
* @@@
* @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
*
*
*
* ### Vacuum inside beam screen ### 
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   MCBXb1v                           1.0   
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  MCBXb1vf  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  MCBXb1vb  
*
* ### Beam screen ### 
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   MCBXb1s                           1.0   
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXb1sf
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXb1sb  
*
* ### Beam screen cooling tubes ### 
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   MCBXb1t                           1.0   
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXb1tf
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXb1tb
*
* ### Beam screen He cooling ### 
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K   MCBXb1h                           1.0   
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  MCBXb1hf
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  MCBXb1hb
*
* ### Vacuum between beam screen and beam pipe ### 
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   MCBXb1c                           1.0   
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  MCBXb1cf  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  MCBXb1cb  
*
* ### Beam pipe ### 
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   MCBXb1p                           1.0   
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXb1pf
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  MCBXb1pb
*
* 
* 
* 
*                                                                              *
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- *
* 'assm' file for BASIC_ELEMENT: 'lhc_MQXABODY'                                *
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- *
*                                                                              *
* 
*
* -*- fluka -*-
*
* Element: MQXA 
*
*
* @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
* @@@
* @@@   FLUKA model of MQXA magnet, A. Lechner, 23/06/2011 
* @@@   based on existing model by C. Hoa
* @@@ 
* @@@   Model origin coincides with mechanical center of MQXA magnet
* @@@ 
* @@@   Refs: 
* @@@     [1] Ajima et al.,
* @@@         The MQXA quadrupoles for the LHC low-beta insertions, 
* @@@         Nucl. Instr. and Meth., Vol 550, Pages 499-513, 2005.
* @@@         DOI: 10.1016/j.nima.2005.04.092.
* @@@     [2] Yamamoto et al.,
* @@@         Design Study of a Superconducting Insertion Quadrupole
* @@@         Magnet for the Large Hadron Collider,
* @@@         IEEE Trans. Appl. Supercond., Vol 7, Pages 747-750, 1997.
* @@@     [3] Tsuchiya et al.,
* @@@         Magnetic Design of a Low-beta Quadrupole Magnet for the
* @@@         LHC Interaction Region,
* @@@         IEEE Trans. Appl. Supercond., Vol 7, Pages 135-138, 2000.
* @@@     
* @@@   Defines: * Use '#define IR5' to rotate beam screen according to  
* @@@              IR5 specs 
* @@@            * Use '#define __TRIPLET_YOKE_BLCKHOLE__' to set
* @@@              yoke to blackhole
* @@@     
* @@@   Hack: Mechanical length reduced by 2 cm to avoid overlagp
* @@@         with adjacent magnet 
* @@@         Better solution for future: correctly implement cold 
* @@@         length 
* @@@     
* @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
*
*
* ### Vacuum inside beam screen ###
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM    QXABSI                           1.0       
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   QXABSIf       
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   QXABSIb       
*
* ### Vacuum between beam screen and pipe ###
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM    QXAVAC                           1.0       
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   QXAVACf       
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   QXAVACb       
*
* ### Helium vessel shell ###
* Material: 304L, Ref. [1] (Section 2.4.3.)
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   QXASHLL                           1.0
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  QXASHLLf
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  QXASHLLb
*
* ### Yoke ###
* Material: low-carbon steel, Ref. [1] (Section 2.4.2.)
#if __TRIPLET_YOKE_BLCKHOLE__
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE   QXAYOKE
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE  QXAYOKEf
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE  QXAYOKEb
#else
ASSIGNMA    cLowCSTL   QXAYOKE                           1.0      
ASSIGNMA    cLowCSTL  QXAYOKEf
ASSIGNMA    cLowCSTL  QXAYOKEb
#endif
*
* ### Helium passage through yoke ###
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K   QXAYKHP                           1.0   
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  QXAYKHPf   
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  QXAYKHPb   
*
* ### Notches in yoke ###
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K   QXAYKNT                           1.0
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  QXAYKNTf
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  QXAYKNTb
*
* ### Keys ###
* Material: 304L, needs confirmation
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   QXAYKKY                           1.0
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  QXAYKKYf
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  QXAYKKYb
*
* ### Keys ###
* Material: 304L, needs confirmation
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   QXAYKPN                           1.0
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  QXAYKPNf
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  QXAYKPNb
*
* ### Collar ###
* Material: KHMN (non-magnetic high-MN steel by Kawasaki), 
* indirect specified in Ref. [1] (see Ref. [15] in Ref. [1], where
* KHMN is explicitly mentioned)
ASSIGNMA     KHMN30L   QXACOLL                           1.0
ASSIGNMA     KHMN30L  QXACOLLf
ASSIGNMA     KHMN30L  QXACOLLb
*
* ### Coils ###
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+..
MATERIAL                           8.085                              NBTIK1
COMPOUND      -0.617     Cu_4K    -0.203    Nb_87K     -0.18    Ti_87KNBTIK1
*
*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+..
MATERIAL                           8.317                              NBTIK2
COMPOUND      -0.718     Cu_4K    -0.282    Nb_87K    -0.132    Ti_87KNBTIK2
ASSIGNMA      NBTIK1   QXAC1P1   QXAC2P4                 1.0
ASSIGNMA      NBTIK1  QXAC1P1f  QXAC2P4f
ASSIGNMA      NBTIK1  QXAC1P1b  QXAC2P4b
*
ASSIGNMA      NBTIK2   QXAC3P1   QXAC5P4                 1.0
ASSIGNMA      NBTIK2  QXAC3P1f  QXAC5P4f
ASSIGNMA      NBTIK2  QXAC3P1b  QXAC5P4b
*
* ### Insulation ###
ASSIGNMA         G10   QXAI1P1   QXAI5P4                 1.0
ASSIGNMA         G10  QXAI1P1f  QXAI5P4f
ASSIGNMA         G10  QXAI1P1b  QXAI5P4b
*
ASSIGNMA    KAPTO87K    QXAKAP                           1.0
ASSIGNMA    KAPTO87K   QXAKAPf          
ASSIGNMA    KAPTO87K   QXAKAPb          
*
* ### Beam screen ###
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L     QXABS                           1.0
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L    QXABSf          
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L    QXABSb          
*
* ### Helium around beam pipe ###
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K   QXALINE                           1.0
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  QXALINEf          
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K  QXALINEb         
*
* ### Helium (beam screen cooling) ###
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K    QXALHe    QXARHe                 1.0
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K   QXALHef   QXARHef
ASSIGNMA    LHe_1.9K   QXALHeb   QXARHeb
*
* ### Tubes (beam screen cooling) ###
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L   QXALcyl   QXARcyl                 1.0
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  QXALcylf  QXARcylf
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L  QXALcylb  QXARcylb
*
* ### Beam pipe ###
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L     QXAbP                           1.0
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L    QXAbPf          
ASSIGNMA     cSS304L    QXAbPb          
*
