* PLEASE READ CAREFULLY
*
*  Keep this file clean. Don't add here compounds related to any material budget
*
*  Keep it commented, expecially if you use non standard materials (differerent
*  density, isotope and neutron x-section). Write a small comment of where you get
*  those parameters so that future users will be able to understand why that
*  particular configuration was used.
*
*
*  Avoid to redefine the implicit fluka materials such as:
